SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Ubud Writers & Readers Festival 2026
LOCATION:Ubud Writers & Readers Festival\, No.88X\, Jl. Raya Sanggingan No.
 88X\, Kedewatan\, Ubud
DESCRIPTION:Join us for compelling\, challenging\, and honest discussions\,
  guided by our 2026 Festival theme: Samarasā: Awareness. Empathy. Action.
  The four-day programme will be guided by the theme Samarasā: Awareness. 
 Empathy. Action.\, which comes from Sanskrit philosophy and emphasises the
  harmony between Citta (mind)\, Rasa (heart)\, and Karsa (action). It invi
 tes reflection on how thought\, feeling\, and action can exist in harmony.
  We explore the forces that shape us to find a perfect balance of awarenes
 s\, empathy\, and action. From the technological to the spiritual\, the pe
 rsonal\, and the environmental\, we trace the cycles of our existence\, no
 t just to understand where we have been\, but to guide humanity toward whe
 re we must go: a future defined by compassionate response. We are also thr
 illed to reveal this year’s artwork by Balinese artist Wayan Aris Sarman
 ta\, a young talent whose work originates from his hometown’s Batuan pai
 nting style. There are more than over 100 events taking place across Ubud\
 , featuring over 150 of Indonesia's and the region's most exciting authors
 \, actors\, journalists\, poets\, and thinkers. Tickets: https://www.ubudw
 ritersfestival.com/tickets\n\nMore info: https://baligasm.com/event/ubud-w
 riters-and-readers-festival-oct-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer b
 efore attending.
URL:https://baligasm.com/event/ubud-writers-and-readers-festival-oct-2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART:20261021T100000Z
DTEND:20261021T110000Z
END:VEVENT
