 Perrinet
LOCATION:Andaz Bali\, by Hyatt
DESCRIPTION:On 22 and 23 October 2026\, Andaz Bali\, by Hyatt\, welcomes th
 e Executive Pastry Chef Asia Pacific at Park Hyatt Tokyo\, Chef Julien Per
 rinet\, for Tropical Reverie\, an exclusive two-day afternoon tea experien
 ce. Famous for his work across the Asia-Pacific\, Chef Julien Perrinet wil
 l bring his pastry expertise from Tokyo all the way to Bali for this speci
 al culinary collaboration. Held at Village Square\, Andaz Bali \, by Hyatt
 \, Chef Julien’s exceptional approach to pastry\, centred around fruit\,
  will prove that this experience is more than just a traditional afternoon
  tea. He will showcase a selection of desserts and savoury bites created s
 pecifically for the two-day Tropical Reverie experience at Andaz Bali. Wit
 h a village-inspired and laid-back setting\, the collaboration offers gues
 ts the opportunity to experience firsthand the combination of meticulous t
 echnique with premium fruit flavours from Les Vergers Boiron for only two 
 days .\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/tropical-re
 verie-a-two-day-exclusive-afternoon-tea-by-chef-julien-perrinet/\n\nPlease
  verify with the organizer before attending.
