  to a beachfront dining experience in Seminyak. Led by Kitchen Manager Che
 f Dipa Mahayana \, The Sayan House combines the delicate flavours of Japan
 ese cuisine with the bold character of South American cooking. For this sp
 ecial brunch\, held from 12 PM to 3.30 PM \, a dedicated buffet station wi
 ll showcase a selection of the restaurant’s signature creations\, offeri
 ng guests a taste of its inventive approach to cross-cultural dining. High
 lights include Ceviche del Mar \, featuring fresh fish with Salsa Veracruz
 \, green Tabasco\, ohba leaf\, lime and shiso oil. Tokyo Curry pairs beef 
 curry sauce and rice with egg\, butter and chimichurri\, while Los De Sash
 imi combines citrus-marinated prawns\, salmon and tuna with fresh vegetabl
 es and wasabi dressing.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-e
