 nspired by the atmosphere of the East. Alice in Wonderland on Ice (2 shows
 : 01 November 2026 starting at 13:00 and starting 16:00) reimagines Lewis 
 Carroll’s timeless story through figure skating\, circus artistry and im
 mersive digital scenography. Alice and the unforgettable characters of Won
 derland come to life through complex choreography\, acrobatics and strikin
 g visual effects that transform the venue into a surreal fantasy world. Tw
 o stories. Two spectacular productions. One ice rink in the heart of Bali.
