  Stories from 1001 Nights on Ice or Alice in Wonderland on Ice. After sele
 cting your session\, you can use the venue seating plan to choose your pre
 ferred seating area and available seats. Please check the show title\, dat
 e and session time carefully before completing your booking\, as different
  sessions may feature different productions. Children Policy Children unde
 r 12 years old must be accompanied by a parent or responsible adult aged 1
 8 or over. Children aged 0–4 may attend with a Kids Ticket. This ticket 
