SUMMARY:SCHOOLIES AT MRS SIPPY
LOCATION:Mrs Sippy Bali\, Jl Taman Ganesha\, Gang Gagak 8\, Seminyak
DESCRIPTION:Show the wristband at the door and you're in. Free. Your crew g
 ets its own section\, so nobody's fighting for a spot. Someone goes off th
 e top diving platform in the first ten minutes\, and that sets the tone fo
 r the whole day. The Schoolies Menu keeps you going\, and the prices are f
 or wristbands only. Giveaways drop all day\, so stay close to the decks. T
 hen the sun drops\, the whole place is on its feet\, and the DJ plays the 
 track that ends up on every story from the trip. That's the day you came t
 o Bali for. Not part of schoolies but still want to visit us? Come anyway.
  Entry is IDR 100\,000 per pax. GRAB YOUR SPOT! Tickets: https://ra.co/eve
 nts/2556641?utm_source=baligasm\n\nMore info: https://baligasm.com/event/m
 rs-sippy-bali-schoolies-nov-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer befor
 e attending.
