DESCRIPTION:THE BEST ABBA SHOW IN THE WORLD! - Endorsed by ABBA! (THIS IS T
 HE BALI\, SUNDAY NIGHT 7.30pm SHOW) “One of the most entertaining live s
 hows in the world today” - Time Out Magazine New York “Absolutely Awes
 ome!” - Dave Grohl\, The Foo Fighters “If ABBA reformed\, they wouldn
 ’t be as much fun as Björn Again” - Q Magazine\, UK “The ABBA Reviv
 al was inevitable\, but Björn Again certainly started it” - Björn Ulva
 eus\, ABBA Indonesia\, get ready to party with Bjorn Again! Fresh from sol
 d-out shows across Sri Lanka\, Hong Kong\, the Philippines\, Malaysia and 
 Singapore\, the world’s number one ABBA tribute show is heading back to 
 Asia for one spectacular night that is bound to be a Super Trouper celebra
 tion of ABBA’s timeless discography. This internationally acclaimed show
  brings the glitter\, the glam\, and all the greatest hits with dazzling e
 nergy\, spot-on vocals\, and outrageous costumes. It’s a full-blown ABBA
  revival where audiences of all ages can sing\, dance\, and party like it
 ’s 1979. Expect all the classics —SOS\, Mamma Mia\, Dancing Queen\, Gi
 mme! Gimme! Gimme! —plus ballads like The Winner Takes It All\, Fernando
 \, and Knowing Me\, Knowing You\, performed with incredible musicianship\,
  a cheeky sense of humour\, and that signature Björn Again magic. With pe
 rformances in over 120 countries\, including The Royal Albert Hall\, Wembl
 ey Stadium\, the Sydney Opera House\, and Glastonbury Festival\, BJÖRN AG
 AIN is a global sensation. Tell your mum\, tell your grumpy teenager\, tel
 l Fernando – tickets won’t last! Tickets: https://megatix.co.id/events
 /BjornagainBALI26?utm_source=baligasm\n\nMore info: https://baligasm.com/e
